---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCatalog } from '../lib/catalog';

const b = getCatalog().business;
---
<Layout title="About">
  <section class="container prose">
    <h1>About HappyCake</h1>
    <p><em>{b.tagline}</em></p>

    <p>
      It started with a phrase: <em>"It's just like homemade."</em>
    </p>

    <p>
      We started baking cakes — as if for ourselves. Delicious, sweet, fresh cakes. People kept
      coming back saying <em>"It tastes like I baked it myself"</em> and we realised that homemade
      taste was the centre of what we wanted to make.
    </p>

    <p>
      Every ingredient is carefully selected. Every cake is hand-decorated and hand-packed. Every
      recipe was perfected over years until it earned its name.
    </p>

    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Open and honest.</strong> We don't delete negative comments — we answer them.</li>
      <li><strong>Creating value.</strong> A cake is more than a cake. Every detail counts.</li>
      <li><strong>Confident.</strong> Confidence comes from the work, not from talking about the work.</li>
      <li><strong>Happy.</strong> Every cake we make is a chance to add a brighter moment to someone's day.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We are not a candy store. Traditional cakes, not exotic flavours of the week.</li>
      <li>We are not custom cakes. Decoration is a small, optional service.</li>
      <li>We are not exclusive. HappyCake is for families who care about traditional values.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Find us</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Where:</strong> {b.location.city}, {b.location.state} · {b.location.region}</li>
      <li><strong>Hours:</strong>
        <ul>
          {Object.entries(b.hours).map(([day, range]) => (
            <li><span style="text-transform:capitalize">{day}</span>: {range}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li><strong>Online:</strong> <a href="https://happycake.us">happycake.us</a></li>
      <li><strong>Message us:</strong> WhatsApp (preferred) — fastest reply during open hours.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>{b.closing_pattern}</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
